          { id: "qna-plateau-vs-minimum-01", level: 2, q: "If all you had was a plot of training loss flattening out over time, how would you reason about whether you're on a plateau versus sitting at an actual minimum, based on what this module says distinguishes the two?", difficulty: "medium" }
