          { id: "qna-surge-engineer-vs-public-criterion-01", level: 2, q: "Contrast the criterion a control engineer would use to judge whether a surge price is 'correct' versus the criterion the public or press effectively uses. Where do those two diverge, and why does that gap matter?", difficulty: "medium" }
